* Fast path: a sum against a sum with a common minuend (le2addd, lesub2dd), the strict hypothesis weakened by ltled.

s1::simp1 |- ( ( A e. RR /\ B e. RR /\ A < B ) -> A e. RR )
s2::simp2 |- ( ( A e. RR /\ B e. RR /\ A < B ) -> B e. RR )
